        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana 88GB24, ADA Compliant Solid Brass 24\" Bathroom Grab Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade with the attention to quality for which Deltana is known, this solid brass grab bar is available in oil rubbed bronze and satin nickel. The modern style of the 88 series 24 inch bathroom grab bar allows it to look good while still being functional; and it is great for any contemporary setting.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-88GB24-specifications.gif?v=1704354546\" width=\"600\" height=\"190\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana 88GB24 24\" Grab Bar Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/18-inch-ada-compliant-bathroom-grab-bar-deltana-88gb18\"><b>18\" 88 Series Grab Bar</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/32-inch-ada-compliant-bathroom-grab-bar-deltana-88gb32\"><b>32\" 88 Series Grab Bar</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/36-inch-ada-compliant-bathroom-grab-bar-deltana-88gb36\"><b>36\" 88 Series Grab Bar</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/42-inch-ada-compliant-bathroom-grab-bar-deltana-88gb42\"><b>42\" 88 Series Grab Bar</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana 88 Series\"><b>Deltana 88 Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the 88 Solid Brass 24 Inch Grab Bar:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 26-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bar Diameter:  1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection From Wall to Bar: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/file